{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The press dispatcher rejected queue.txt again and tonight's print run is\nwaiting. The ordering rules are in DISPATCH.md and audit.py is the\npre-flight check the dispatcher runs. Fix queue.txt so `python3 audit.py`\npasses, then run ./enqueue.sh to hand the queue to the press."}
